      en: ["The Buddha image is approximately 3.8 meters tall and weighs over 6 tons.", "King Bodawpaya brought the statue to Mandalay in 1784 as war booty.", "Only men are permitted to enter the inner sanctum to apply gold leaf.", "The gold layer on the statue's body is currently about 15 cm (6 inches) thick.", "The temple houses six ancient Khmer bronze statues taken from Angkor Wat.", "The daily face-washing ritual for the Buddha image begins at 4:00 AM sharp."],
