      en: ["The pagoda was constructed in 1816 by Prince Bagyidaw for his late wife.", "The structure symbolizes Mount Meru from traditional Buddhist cosmology.", "Seven undulating terraces represent the seven seas surrounding the universe.", "The massive earthquake of 1839 caused significant structural damage.", "King Mindon oversaw the complete restoration of the site in 1874.", "The pagoda is located in Mingun, roughly 10 kilometers north of Mandalay."],
      es: ["Año de construcción: 1816.", "Altura: 30 metros.", "Número de terrazas: 7.", "Promotor: Príncipe Bagyidaw.", "La pagoda es completamente blanca.", "Se encuentra en Mingun, a 11 km de Mandalay."],
      pt: ["Ano de construção: 1816.", "Altura: 30 metros.", "Número de terraços: 7.", "Promotor: Príncipe Bagyidaw.", "O pagode é completamente branco.", "Situa-se em Mingun, a 11 km de Mandalay."],
      fr: ["Année de construction : 1816.", "Hauteur : 30 mètres.", "Nombre de terrasses : 7.", "Commanditaire : Prince Bagyidaw.", "La pagode est entièrement blanche.", "Elle se trouve à Mingun, à 11 km de Mandalay."],
